  <h2 class="section-title" data-ur="1. Freelancing Kya Hoti Hai?" data-en="1. What Is Freelancing?">1. Freelancing Kya Hoti Hai?</h2>
  <div class="card">
    <p data-ur="Freelancing ka matlab hai ke aap kisi company ke mulazim nahi hote, balke aap apni marzi se duniya bhar ke logon ka kaam karte hain aur us ke paise lete hain." data-en="Freelancing means you are not an employee of any company, but you work for people around the world on your own terms and get paid for it.">Freelancing ka matlab hai ke aap kisi company ke mulazim nahi hote, balke aap apni marzi se duniya bhar ke logon ka kaam karte hain aur us ke paise lete hain.</p>
    <p data-ur="Misaal ke tor par, agar kisi ko logo banwana hai, video edit karwani hai, ya website banwani hai, to woh aap ko paise de ga aur aap us ka kaam kar ke den ge. Aap ghar baithe kaam karen ge aur paise aap ke bank ya JazzCash mein aa jayen ge." data-en="For example, if someone needs a logo, video editing, or a website, he will pay you and you will do his work. You will work from home and money will come to your bank or JazzCash.">Misaal ke tor par, agar kisi ko logo banwana hai, video edit karwani hai, ya website banwani hai, to woh aap ko paise de ga aur aap us ka kaam kar ke den ge. Aap ghar baithe kaam karen ge aur paise aap ke bank ya JazzCash mein aa jayen ge.</p>
  </div>

  <h2 class="section-title" data-ur="2. Freelancing Ke Liye Kaun Si Skill Seekhen?" data-en="2. Which Skill To Learn For Freelancing?">2. Freelancing Ke Liye Kaun Si Skill Seekhen?</h2>
  <div class="card">
    <p data-ur="Shuru mein sab se bari ghalti ye hoti hai ke log sochte hain ke un ko sab kuch aana chahiye. Aisa nahi hai. Aap ko sirf ek skill achi tarah seekhni hai." data-en="In the beginning the biggest mistake is that people think they should know everything. It is not like that. You have to learn only one skill properly.">Shuru mein sab se bari ghalti ye hoti hai ke log sochte hain ke un ko sab kuch aana chahiye. Aisa nahi hai. Aap ko sirf ek skill achi tarah seekhni hai.</p>
    <h3 data-ur="Pakistan Mein Sab Se Zyada Chalne Wali Skills:" data-en="Most Demanded Skills In Pakistan:">Pakistan Mein Sab Se Zyada Chalne Wali Skills:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li data-ur="Graphic Designing: Logo, poster, YouTube thumbnail banana" data-en="Graphic Designing: Making logo, poster, YouTube thumbnail">Graphic Designing: Logo, poster, YouTube thumbnail banana</li>
      <li data-ur="Video Editing: YouTube aur TikTok video edit karna" data-en="Video Editing: Editing YouTube and TikTok videos">Video Editing: YouTube aur TikTok video edit karna</li>
      <li data-ur="Website Banana: WordPress ya HTML se saadha website banana" data-en="Website Making: Making simple website with WordPress or HTML">Website Banana: WordPress ya HTML se saadha website banana</li>
      <li data-ur="Copywriting: Article aur blog likhna" data-en="Copywriting: Writing articles and blogs">Copywriting: Article aur blog likhna</li>
      <li data-ur="Data Entry Aur Virtual Assistant: Sab se aasan kaam, naye logon ke liye behtareen" data-en="Data Entry And Virtual Assistant: Easiest work, best for new people">Data Entry Aur Virtual Assistant: Sab se aasan kaam, naye logon ke liye behtareen</li>
      <li data-ur="Social Media Management: Facebook aur Instagram page chalana" data-en="Social Media Management: Running Facebook and Instagram pages">Social Media Management: Facebook aur Instagram page chalana</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="tip" id="tip1">Mashwara: Shuru mein sirf ek skill chunen. 1 mahina isi ko roz 2 ghante den. YouTube se free mein seekhen, paise kharch karne ki zaroorat nahi.</div>

  <h2 class="section-title" data-ur="3. Fiverr Par Account Kaise Banayen?" data-en="3. How To Create Account On Fiverr?">3. Fiverr Par Account Kaise Banayen?</h2>
  <div class="card">
    <p data-ur="Fiverr naye logon ke liye sab se aasan platform hai." data-en="Fiverr is the easiest platform for new people.">Fiverr naye logon ke liye sab se aasan platform hai.</p>
    <ul>
      <li data-ur="Sab se pehle Fiverr.com par jayen aur Sign Up karen" data-en="First go to Fiverr.com and Sign Up">Sab se pehle Fiverr.com par jayen aur Sign Up karen</li>
      <li data-ur="Apna asli naam aur achi si profile tasveer lagayen" data-en="Use your real name and a good profile photo">Apna asli naam aur achi si profile tasveer lagayen</li>
      <li data-ur="Apni skill ke bare mein 2-3 linon mein likhen, jaise 'Mein khoobsurat logo banata hoon'" data-en="Write 2-3 lines about your skill, like 'I make beautiful logos'">Apni skill ke bare mein 2-3 linon mein likhen, jaise 'Mein khoobsurat logo banata hoon'</li>
      <li data-ur="Ab apni pehli Gig banayen. Gig ka matlab hai aap ki service, jaise 'Mein aap ke liye professional logo banaon ga'" data-en="Now create your first Gig. Gig means your service, like 'I will make a professional logo for you'">Ab apni pehli Gig banayen. Gig ka matlab hai aap ki service, jaise 'Mein aap ke liye professional logo banaon ga'</li>
      <li data-ur="Gig mein apni banai hui 3-4 achi tasveeren lagayen" data-en="Add 3-4 good images you made in the Gig">Gig mein apni banai hui 3-4 achi tasveeren lagayen</li>
      <li data-ur="Shuru mein qeemat kam rakhen, jaise 5 Dollar, taake pehla order jaldi aaye" data-en="Keep price low in the beginning, like 5 Dollars, so first order comes quickly">Shuru mein qeemat kam rakhen, jaise 5 Dollar, taake pehla order jaldi aaye</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <h2 class="section-title" data-ur="4. Upwork Par Kaam Kaise Milta Hai?" data-en="4. How To Get Work On Upwork?">4. Upwork Par Kaam Kaise Milta Hai?</h2>
  <div class="card">
    <p data-ur="Upwork par aap ko khud logon ki post par apply karna parta hai. Rozana 5-10 jobs par acha sa message likh kar bhejen." data-en="On Upwork you have to apply yourself on people's job posts. Daily send a good message on 5-10 jobs.">Upwork par aap ko khud logon ki post par apply karna parta hai. Rozana 5-10 jobs par acha sa message likh kar bhejen.</p>
    <p data-ur="Message mein kabhi bhi ye na likhen ke 'Mujhe kaam de den'. Balke ye likhen ke 'Mein aap ka ye kaam is tarah karoon ga, aur 2 din mein mukammal kar doon ga.' Client ko hamesha hal batayen, bheek na mangen." data-en="Never write in the message 'Give me work'. Instead write 'I will do your work like this, and complete it in 2 days.' Always tell the client the solution, do not beg.">Message mein kabhi bhi ye na likhen ke 'Mujhe kaam de den'. Balke ye likhen ke 'Mein aap ka ye kaam is tarah karoon ga, aur 2 din mein mukammal kar doon ga.' Client ko hamesha hal batayen, bheek na mangen.</p>
  </div>

  <h2 class="section-title" data-ur="5. Pehla Order Kaise Len? - Sab Se Ahem Baat" data-en="5. How To Get First Order? - Most Important Thing">5. Pehla Order Kaise Len? - Sab Se Ahem Baat</h2>
  <div class="card">
    <p data-ur="Pehla order aana sab se mushkil hota hai, lekin ek dafa aa gaya to phir kaam aata hi rehta hai." data-en="Getting the first order is the hardest, but once it comes, work keeps coming.">Pehla order aana sab se mushkil hota hai, lekin ek dafa aa gaya to phir kaam aata hi rehta hai.</p>
    <ul>
      <li data-ur="Shuru mein apne doston aur rishtedaron ka kaam free ya kam paison mein kar ke apna portfolio banayen" data-en="In the beginning, make your portfolio by doing work for friends and relatives for free or low price">Shuru mein apne doston aur rishtedaron ka kaam free ya kam paison mein kar ke apna portfolio banayen</li>
      <li data-ur="Apne kaam ki tasveeren Facebook aur WhatsApp Status par lagayen" data-en="Post photos of your work on Facebook and WhatsApp Status">Apne kaam ki tasveeren Facebook aur WhatsApp Status par lagayen</li>
      <li data-ur="Client ko jawab jaldi den, 5 minute ke andar jawab dene wale ko kaam zyada milta hai" data-en="Reply to client quickly, the one who replies within 5 minutes gets more work">Client ko jawab jaldi den, 5 minute ke andar jawab dene wale ko kaam zyada milta hai</li>
      <li data-ur="Kaam waqt par mukammal karen, chahe raat ko jaagna pare" data-en="Complete work on time, even if you have to stay awake at night">Kaam waqt par mukammal karen, chahe raat ko jaagna pare</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <h2 class="section-title" data-ur="6. Paise Kaise Nikalwayen?" data-en="6. How To Withdraw Money?">6. Paise Kaise Nikalwayen?</h2>
  <div class="card"><p data-ur="Pakistan mein freelancers zyada tar Payoneer ya PayPal ke zariye paise nikalwate hain. Fiverr se aap paise Payoneer mein le kar phir apne bank account ya JazzCash mein le sakte hain. Shuru mein aap ko is ki fikar karne ki zaroorat nahi, pehle skill seekhen aur order len, paise nikalne ka tareeqa baad mein khud samajh aa jaye ga." data-en="In Pakistan, freelancers mostly withdraw money through Payoneer or PayPal. From Fiverr you can take money to Payoneer and then to your bank account or JazzCash. In the beginning you do not need to worry about this, first learn skill and take order, the withdrawal method will be understood later by itself.">Pakistan mein freelancers zyada tar Payoneer ya PayPal ke zariye paise nikalwate hain. Fiverr se aap paise Payoneer mein le kar phir apne bank account ya JazzCash mein le sakte hain. Shuru mein aap ko is ki fikar karne ki zaroorat nahi, pehle skill seekhen aur order len, paise nikalne ka tareeqa baad mein khud samajh aa jaye ga.</p></div>

  <h2 class="section-title" data-ur="7. Freelancing Mein Kamyab Hone Ke 5 Usool" data-en="7. 5 Rules To Succeed In Freelancing">7. Freelancing Mein Kamyab Hone Ke 5 Usool</h2>
  <div class="card">
    <ul>
      <li data-ur="Roz ka kaam: Roz kam az kam 1 ghanta seekhne aur 1 ghanta client dhoondhne mein lagayen" data-en="Daily work: Daily spend at least 1 hour learning and 1 hour finding clients">Roz ka kaam: Roz kam az kam 1 ghanta seekhne aur 1 ghanta client dhoondhne mein lagayen</li>
      <li data-ur="Imaandari: Jo kaam nahi aata, woh na len. Jo liya hai, woh poora karen" data-en="Honesty: Do not take work you do not know. Complete the work you took">Imaandari: Jo kaam nahi aata, woh na len. Jo liya hai, woh poora karen</li>
      <li data-ur="Sabar: Pehle 1-2 mahine mein order na bhi aaye to haar na manen" data-en="Patience: Even if order does not come in first 1-2 months, do not give up">Sabar: Pehle 1-2 mahine mein order na bhi aaye to haar na manen</li>
      <li data-ur="Achi baat cheet: Client se ache tareeqe se baat karen, English kamzor hai to Google Translate istemal karen" data-en="Good communication: Talk to client nicely, if English is weak use Google Translate">Achi baat cheet: Client se ache tareeqe se baat karen, English kamzor hai to Google Translate istemal karen</li>
      <li data-ur="Seekhte rahen: Har mahine apni skill mein kuch naya seekhen" data-en="Keep learning: Learn something new in your skill every month">Seekhte rahen: Har mahine apni skill mein kuch naya seekhen</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="notice" id="noticeText">Aakhri Baat: Freelancing koi jadoo nahi hai ke aaj shuru karen aur kal lakh pati ban jayen. Lekin agar aap 3 mahine lagatar mehnat karen ge to aap ki kamai shuru ho jaye gi. Aaj hi ek skill chunen aur seekhna shuru kar den.</div>
